{'symbol': 'SWK', 'date': '2022-06-28 06:45:00', 'title': 'STANLEY BLACK & DECKER REACHES AGREEMENT TO SELL ITS OIL & GAS BUSINESS', 'text': "TRANSACTION FURTHER ADVANCES STANLEY BLACK & DECKER'S PORTFOLIO TRANSFORMATION AND STRATEGIC FOCUS ON CORE BUSINESSES NEW BRITAIN, CONN. , JUNE 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 STANLEY BLACK & DECKER (NYSE: SWK) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS SIGNED A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT FOR THE SALE OF ITS STANLEY OIL & GAS BUSINESS TO PIPELINE TECHNIQUE LIMITED, A LEADING PROVIDER OF SOLUTIONS TO THE ENERGY INDUSTRY."}